<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (File In the menu, there are four "File" options which manage song data. "Save" will save the currently loaded song. The song is auto saved when exiting the mode with the "Exit" option or the Menu button, but NOT if you turn off the Swadge! "Save As" will save the song in the slot of your choice. There are four slots. "Load" will load a song from a slot with data in it. "Reset This Song" will reset the grid to empty. This does not affect saved data.)
/E (File In the menu, there are four "File" options which manage song data. "Save" will save the currently loaded song. The song is auto saved when exiting the mode with the "Exit" option or the Menu button, but NOT if you turn off the Swadge! "Save As" will save the song in the slot of your choice. There are four slots. "Load" will load a song from a slot with data in it. "Reset This Song" will reset the grid to empty. This does not affect saved data.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
